        ":question/problem": "![](images/1a/1a9b092dbb1a08d4cfc877ab4dc62e68ca90663bc87b810354e4973a90ff8d9a.png)\n\nThe graph above shows the altitude of airplane $A$ and airplane $B$ after they have taken off, one after the other. After how many minutes will both planes be at the same altitude?",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we need to find the point of intersection of the two graphs.\n\n![](images/6c/6c0b061e315f7470aa16c034b92592306ca2f56885af03e3e5d6646619c8f02f.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(12,20).$ So, it takes $12$ minutes for both planes to get to the same altitude (of $20,000\\,\\text{ft}$)."
      },
